request.description:
Direct online payment shortcut. Equivalent to GET /qr/:token?purpose=payment&intent=online.

App response — static QR (HitPay URL on the QR record):
```json
{
  "data": {
    "type": "payment_online_static",
    "paymentUrl": "https://hitpay.com/...",
    "branchId": "branch_abc",
    "merchantId": "merchant_xyz"
  }
}
```

App response — dynamic QR (no static URL; app creates a payment request):
```json
{
  "data": {
    "type": "payment_online_dynamic",
    "branchId": "branch_abc",
    "merchantId": "merchant_xyz"
  }
}
```

App clients must be authenticated (401 otherwise).
Errors: 400 if branch does not support online payment; 404 if token is inactive.

Direct menu shortcut. Equivalent to GET /qr/:token?purpose=menu.

App response:
```json
{
  "data": {
    "type": "menu",
    "menu": {
      "url": "https://example.com/menu.pdf",
      "images": []
    },
    "branchName": "Orchard Branch",
    "merchantId": "merchant_xyz",
    "branchId": "branch_abc"
  }
}
```

Browser: redirects directly to menu URL when set, or renders image gallery when only images are present.
Errors: 404 if menu is not enabled or has no content.

Direct onboarding (referral) shortcut. Equivalent to GET /qr/:token?purpose=onboarding.

App response:
```json
{
  "data": {
    "type": "onboarding",
    "referralCode": "ABC123",
    "deepLink": "shopnjoy://ref/ABC123",
    "isAppClient": true
  }
}
```

Browser: renders page showing the referral code (auto-copies to clipboard) and redirects to App Store.

