request.description:
Returns all active tags attached to a specific ticket.

Response shape:
{
  data: {
    assignments: TagAssignment[],  // includes assignedBy, assignedByType, createdAt
    tags: Tag[]                    // full Tag objects (name, slug, color, category, …)
  }
}

Returns all entity IDs bearing this tag, grouped by entity type.

Example response:
{
  data: [
    { tagId: "tag_xxx", entityType: "ticket", entityIds: ["ticket_aaa", "ticket_bbb"] },
    { tagId: "tag_xxx", entityType: "merchant", entityIds: ["merchant_ccc"] }
  ]
}

Sends the default resolution email to all ticket reporters tagged with this tag.

Default message:
"The issue associated with \"<tag name>\" has been resolved. Your support ticket has been addressed and the underlying problem is now fixed."

Response:
{
  data: {
    notified: 12,          // emails successfully sent
    skipped: 1,            // tickets with no email or missing ticket
    tagId: "tag_xxx",
    tagName: "Payment Gateway Outage",
    lastNotifiedAt: "2026-03-18T08:00:00.000Z"
  }
}

